  _speakerName: Seraphine
  _dialogueSegments:
  - An Orc chieftain named Gor'Vakh has claimed the Forgotten Sanctum. The corruption
    surrounding that place has changed him, and something precious remains trapped
    within.
  - I cannot abandon my post, but perhaps you can succeed where others have failed.
  - Take this Torch. Its flame will allow you to ignite the ancient lanterns and
    break the seal that conceals him.
  - 'Defeat Gor''Vakh, recover the relic he guards, and bring it to me.

    Will
    you accept this task?'
  _dialogueText: 'An Orc chieftain named Gor''Vakh has claimed the Forgotten Sanctum.
    The corruption surrounding that place has changed him, and something precious
    remains trapped within.

    I cannot abandon my post, but perhaps you can succeed
    where others have failed.

    Take this Torch. Its flame will allow you to ignite
    the ancient lanterns and break the seal that conceals him.

    Defeat Gor''Vakh,
    recover the relic he guards, and bring it to me.

    Will you accept this task?'
  _choices:
  - _choiceText: I'll investigate the Forgotten Sanctum.
